{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","灿烂花语"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一个目标标记“花语”，之后对场上所有被“花语”标记的目标造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名未被“花语”标记的敌人标记“花语”直至战斗结束，之后对所有被“花语”标记目标以及周围1格的敌人造成480% ATK伤害。被攻击的目标在2秒内受到多次该技能伤害时，后续伤害均降低20%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至490% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每个被标记“花语”的敌人被击败时，帕瑞莎在接下来的5秒内每秒回复60 + 20点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","繁花祈佑"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己与一名友军提升攻击速度与普通攻击伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为自己与最近的1名友军提升22 + 3点攻击速度，并使自己和该名友军的普通攻击伤害提高22%，持续10秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","提升的攻击速度提高至25 + 3，普通攻击伤害提升比例提高至25%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","提升的攻击速度提高至28 + 3，普通攻击伤害提升比例提高至28%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","提升的攻击速度提高至30 + 3，普通攻击伤害提升比例提高至30%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","花意漫漫"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","每当自己进行若干次普通攻击伤害，下一次普通攻击将改为发射花丛对沿途所有敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当帕瑞莎累计进行3次普通攻击，自身的下一次普通攻击将改为向目标所在的方向发射一团持续蔓延的花丛，对沿途的所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害。花丛每击中一名敌人，将使自己额外回复70能量，同一个花丛最多产生3次额外回能效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","花丛伤害提升至205% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","花丛伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","花丛伤害提升至215% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","盛开时刻"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，给最接近对称位置的敌人标记“花语”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，给最接近对称位置的敌人标记“花语”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","累计标记4次“花语”后，普通攻击会额外攻击1个目标。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","累计标记3次“花语”后，普通攻击会额外攻击1个目标。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","累计标记2次“花语”后，普通攻击会额外攻击1个目标。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放技能“花意漫漫”所需的普通攻击次数降低。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放技能“花意漫漫”所需的普通攻击次数降低-1次。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“繁花祈佑”不再有初始冷却时间。首次释放本技能后，“繁花祈佑”会额外选择1名友军作为目标。额外目标优先选择造成普攻伤害最高的友军。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","飞花手杖"]]}